 source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.6, pp. 95–97; local normal-form interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free grammar, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\,\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;(\\alpha=a\\beta)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\,\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;(\\alpha=a\\beta)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{GNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{GNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Every non-epsilon production emits exactly one terminal before a string of nonterminals; the former unbound display <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to a\\beta\">\\(A\\to a\\beta\\)</span> has been absorbed into the quantified clause.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-structure]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\,\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;(\\alpha=a\\beta)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{GNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\to a\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":1902,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-379","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-standard-gnf|Greibach Normal Form]]"},{"id":"b1945eaeb0e1f49f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-cfg-language-class]]。带开始符号空词例外的 $\\operatorname{GNF}$ 见 [[73-df-standard-gnf]]；仅含 $A\\to a\\beta$ 的旧 $\\mathrm{GNF}$ 见 [[73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation]]，均取同一 $\\Sigma$。"}],"outgoing":["33052f37223a11c6"]}